# Otomatik uretildi: FIX-YEDEK/selinux/avc2te.py
# Kaynak: cihazin permissive boot'unda biriken "avc: denied" kayitlari
# (dmesg). Global Enforcing'e gecis icin gerekli allow kurallari.
# Yeni denial cikinca: avc2te.py ile yeniden uret veya buraya ekle.
#
# Not: init/vendor_init/fsck* hala permissive oldugu icin onlarin kaynak
# oldugu denials BILEREK disarida birakildi (--skip-scontext).
#
# Not: Asagidaki stok-blob kaynakli domain'ler permissive birakildigi icin
# (bkz. permissive.te) onlarin neverallow'a takilan kurallari burada YOK:
#   gatekeeperd (vendor_file), hal_memtrack_default (debugfs),
#   hal_wifi_default / hal_wifi_supplicant_default (system_data_file),
#   rild (system_file), hal_bluetooth_default (default_prop).
# Bu domain'ler ileride tek tek relabel + allow ile enforcing'e alinabilir.

# --- /dev/stune (schedtune) relabel --------------------------------
# Bu cihazda /dev/stune tmpfs uzerinde duruyor; AOSP'nin "genfscon cgroup"
# etiketi uygulanmadigi icin dosyalar genel "device" tipine dusuyordu ve
# coredomain'ler foreground/tasks'a yazarken
#   neverallow { coredomain ... } device:file no_rw_file_perms
# yasagina takiliyordu. file_contexts ile "stune_file" tipine etiketlendi
# (bkz. file.te, file_contexts).
#
# DIKKAT: cihaz sepolicy'si BOARD_SEPOLICY_DIRS ile VENDOR politikasina
# derlenir; vendor pol yalnizca vendor + PUBLIC tipleri gorur. storaged/gsid
# gibi PLAT-PRIVATE domain'ler tek tek yazilamaz (ne allow ne permissive).
# "coredomain" ise PUBLIC bir attribute oldugu icin kullanilabilir; nihai
# politikada storaged/gsid/zygote/netd/installd/system_server vb. tum cekirdek
# domain'leri kapsar. (appdomain coredomain'e dahil DEGIL, bkz. domain.te.)
# logd/logpersist/recovery_refresh/recovery_persist ise kendi neverallow'lari
# geregi stune'a yazamaz; bunlar cikarilir (hepsi public tip, vendor pol'de
# isimlendirilebilir).
allow { coredomain -logd -logpersist -recovery_refresh -recovery_persist } stune_file:file rw_file_perms;

# Dizin gecisi (traversal): AOSP'de "allow domain cgroup:dir search" karsiligi.
# Uygulama domain'leri (untrusted_app/priv_app/system_app/platform_app) ve
# zygote/mediaserver/mediaprovider /dev/stune altindaki tasks dosyalarina
# ulasmak icin dizini search etmek zorunda (aksi halde "avc denied search
# stune_file:dir" ile bloklanir).
allow domain stune_file:dir search;

# --- HAL'lar ---
allow hal_audio_default imei_efs_file:dir { search };
allow hal_audio_default imei_efs_file:file { getattr open read };
allow hal_graphics_composer_default hal_graphics_composer_default:netlink_kobject_uevent_socket { bind create read setopt };
allow hal_power_default sysfs_devices_system_cpu:file { write };
allow hal_wifi_default efs_file:file { open read };
allow hal_wifi_supplicant_default efs_file:file { open read };
allow hwservicemanager init:dir { search };
allow hwservicemanager init:file { open read };
allow hwservicemanager init:process { getattr };

# --- cekirdek servisler ---
allow mediacodec sysfs:file { getattr open read };
allow system_server init:fifo_file { write };
allow vold rootfs:dir { setattr write };
allow vold sysfs_sswap:file { write };
allow cbd sysfs:file { open read };

# --- medya / uygulamalar ---
allow mediaprovider rootfs:dir { open read };
allow mediaprovider rootfs:file { getattr };
allow toolbox shell_data_file:file { getattr write };
